Objective: Be the first to obtain 20 eco-sphere rating

Planet: Long Floes
Clan: The Chosen

Notes: Player fights for the Chosen Clan. His air units plants can produce significantly improved units but the challenge of this mission is to survive long enough to produce them. He has only 4 scouts, the only combat units available at the start. The world is a single continent which leaves him very exposed to possible early strikes by powerful ground units, such as tanks.

Hint: The solution may be hidden in the mission name!

